F-12 addressed in `237bd78`.

`ORDERED + SYMMETRIC` is no longer a legal combination. In ordered mode the only permitted declarations are `ASYMMETRIC` and `UNSPECIFIED`; `SYMMETRIC` is forbidden until ordered semantics are approved.

